frontend-tree-go-tokens: addendum to 00785 (same impl block). syntax-bridge, mbe and hir-def tests call `parse.debug_dump()` on token_tree_to_syntax_node's parse, which only `Parse<SourceFile>` has. In the `impl Parse<Untyped>` of 00785 add:

    /// The tree, one element a line ([`Node`]'s `{:#?}`), then its errors: the text
    /// `Parse::<SourceFile>::debug_dump` gives.
    pub fn debug_dump(&self) -> String {
        // alloc: test and debug output only.
        let mut buf = format!("{:#?}", self.root());
        for err in self.errors() {
            format_to!(buf, "error {:?}: {}\n", err.range(), err);
        }
        buf
    }

(`format_to` as lib.rs imports it: `use stdx::format_to;`.)
